{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50383","headline":"漳州新城秋宴 · 陈元光","name":"漳州新城秋宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地险行台壮，天清景幕新。\n鸿飞青嶂杳，鹭点碧波真。\n风肃天如水，霜高月散银。\n婵娟争泼眼，廉洁正成隣。\n东涌沧溟玉，西呈翠巘珍。\n画船拖素练，朱榭映红云。\n琥珀盃方酌，鲛绡席未尘。\n秦箫吹引鳯，邹律奏生春。\n缥{糹耳少}纤歌遏，婆娑妙舞神。\n会知冥漠处，百怪恼精魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}